  "text": "The 2027 solar eclipse turns midday into night for over six minutes. The moon's shadow spans two hundred and fifty-eight kilometers. That nearly triples 2026's two-minute eclipse. Totality crosses Spain and North Africa, peaking over Egypt at six minutes twenty-three seconds. Millions can look up as",
